<P>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <A HREF="legal.html#1intent">Two
Fundamental Questions Have Arisen</A>
<UL>
<UL>
<LI>
How much public information do private citizens have the right to demand</LI>

<LI>
Can government agencies recover costs by selling public data</LI>
</UL>
</UL>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <A HREF="legal.html#1choices">Agencies
Have Three Basic Choices</A>
<UL>
<UL>
<LI>
They can bear the full cost of information generation and distribution</LI>

<LI>
They can recover distribution costs</LI>

<LI>
They can attempt to generate income</LI>
</UL>
</UL>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <A HREF="legal.html#1fira">The
